# ── Self-audit churn containment (tt-rd audit 2026-09-27; coding/self-audit-receipt-rule.ts) ──
# Audit facts: ≥38.5 % of one project's $1,062 / 14 d went to self-audit passes re-verifying closed work;
# fleet 4,857 harness audit rounds on 7,009 coding runs (mean shed $0.318), ddd26be0 224/244 runs audited
# TWICE (its own "SA2" step + the harness round). Every switch below restores the pre-2026-09-27 behaviour.
# SELF_AUDIT_DUPLICATE_STEP_SKIP_DISABLED=1   # the lane's own COMPLETED self-audit / re-verify plan step (+ ≥1 ok evidence receipt this run)
#                                             # no longer skips the harness round (loop_metrics self_audit_skip reason 'duplicate_step')
#                                             # edit in a step title re-arms the round (default: goal + acceptance criteria + id:status only)
# (2026-10-04) forwarded by docker-compose.app.yml since the coding quick-wins PR — before that a box override never reached the container; prod: act (boxes A + C)
# SELF_AUDIT_RECEIPT_RULE_MODE=shadow         # shadow (default) | act — the deterministic receipt rule (every completed step joins an ok
#                                             # receipt ∧ the last verify passed on this tree ∧ no reject-back): shadow = evaluated + recorded on the
#                                             # self_audit_run row (meta.receiptRule), act = skips the round except a 1-in-10 CONTROL sample that runs
#                                             # it with control:true (self_audit_control rows); control reopen rate > 1.8 % + 2 pt over ≥30 rows
#                                             # writes ['instance','self-audit-receipt-rule']/state {demoted:true} → act runs as shadow. Consulted BEFORE
#                                             # the Jev self_audit purpose, which is ACT-CAPPED in code (AUROC 0.232; DECISION_GATE_SELF_AUDIT_ACT_CAP_DISABLED=1 lifts).
#                                             # Fixer 2026-09-27: a blocked-plan board NEVER skips (reason blocked_steps — the blocker re-probe is the
#                                             # round's other job); every evaluated round that RUNS outside the control sample writes a self_audit_shadow
#                                             # {wouldSkip, mode, reopened, steps, receipted, reasons, rejectBacksAfter, guardStrikesAfter} label row and the
#                                             # promotion readout (≥ 200 labelled wouldSkip rows, reopen ≤ 3.8 %) is stamped at
#                                             # ['instance','self-audit-receipt-rule']/readiness — the flip to act stays THIS env; the verify-TREE capture
#                                             # (git add -A into a throwaway index, up to 150 s) runs ONLY in act and only once every cheaper term passes,
#                                             # via the side-effect-free captureWorktreeTree (an unknown tree in act never skips); shadow records the
#                                             # HEAD-sha match (readHeadSha, ms) + captureMs on the row
# SELF_AUDIT_RECEIPT_RULE_DISABLED=1          # the receipt rule is neither evaluated nor recorded
# SELF_AUDIT_PROMPT_V2_DISABLED=1             # the pre-2026-09-27 [HARNESS SELF-AUDIT] wording (re-run everything; no "ONLY audit this firing",
#                                             # no cite-the-receipt exemption, no one-cheap-check bound, no TERMINAL clause)
# SELF_AUDIT_SKIP_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1        # no self_audit_skip / self_audit_control / self_audit_shadow loop_metrics rows (the selfAuditRoundId stamp on
#                                             # self_audit_run + run_spend stays — it is what makes the audit's shed cost joinable on every round)
# EVIDENCE_GUARD_CARRIED_RECEIPTS_DISABLED=1  # evidence guard: a machine-run claim naming a STABLE artifact (PR number / pushed sha) that an
#                                             # EARLIER run of the same chat receipted (≤7 d, newest 200) is marked UNVERIFIED again instead of
#                                             # '[CARRIED from run <id8> <ts>]' (observe-only; guard_miss seam 'carried_receipt'); claims phrased
#                                             # as fresh (this run / just now / re-probed / a clock stamp) always need a fresh receipt
# EVIDENCE_GUARD_DEPLOY_OBSERVATION_DISABLED=1  # F32 (2026-10-22) evidence guard: restores the action-only deploy evidence tier — a pure
#                                  # OBSERVATION sentence ("health check 200", "prod green", "digby.ai healthy", no deploy verb) is then
#                                  # provable ONLY by run_command/git_/github_ receipts again (get_fleet_telemetry / web health reads stop
#                                  # evidencing it); deploy-verb lines were always action-only and are unchanged.
# CODE_SEARCH_CHAT_SCOPE_REFUSE_DISABLED=1  # fs-code-knowledge (2026-10-22): restores the old search_code_semantic — it searches ctx.projectId
#                                  # whatever it is (an ungrouped chat's sentinel scope 'chat' holds no code rows) and a miss reads "the index
