#                                          # removed; when the child's latest hand-off record already posted on THIS chat
#                                          # (latestDeliverableHandoff), the finalize ALWAYS persists NO
#                                          # running card — the hand-off row (with its done card) IS the result; a card that read done never regresses.
#                                          # parent too. Default: a FAILED machine run on a child of a human-owned NON-supervisor parent posts ONE
